<figure class="chapter-visual ingredient-hierarchy">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创示意图：LSDA 与 GGA 使用的信息层级</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original diagram: information supplied to LSDA and GGA</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="ingredient-title ingredient-desc">
    <title id="ingredient-title">Information hierarchy for LSDA and GGA functionals</title>
    <desc id="ingredient-desc">
      LSDA receives the local spin-up and spin-down densities at one position. GGA receives the same local densities together with density gradients. Neither input list includes nonlocal density information or an orbital dependence.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="ingredient-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" class="ingredient-hierarchy__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(38 34)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="205" height="88" rx="12" class="ingredient-hierarchy__box" />
      <text x="102" y="31" text-anchor="middle">local spin densities</text>
      <text x="102" y="57" text-anchor="middle">n↑(r), n↓(r)</text>
      <text x="102" y="79" text-anchor="middle">局域自旋密度</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="255" y1="78" x2="345" y2="78" marker-end="url(#ingredient-arrow)" class="ingredient-hierarchy__arrow" />

    <g transform="translate(360 34)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="205" height="88" rx="12" class="ingredient-hierarchy__box ingredient-hierarchy__box--accent" />
      <text x="102" y="32" text-anchor="middle">LSDA energy density</text>
      <text x="102" y="58" text-anchor="middle">εxc(n↑, n↓)</text>
      <text x="102" y="79" text-anchor="middle">均匀电子气局域取样</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(38 190)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="250" height="100" rx="12" class="ingredient-hierarchy__box" />
      <text x="125" y="28" text-anchor="middle">local densities + gradients</text>
      <text x="125" y="55" text-anchor="middle">n↑, n↓, ∇n↑, ∇n↓</text>
      <text x="125" y="79" text-anchor="middle">或等价无量纲组合 s, t, ζ</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="300" y1="240" x2="390" y2="240" marker-end="url(#ingredient-arrow)" class="ingredient-hierarchy__arrow" />

    <g transform="translate(405 190)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="250" height="100" rx="12" class="ingredient-hierarchy__box ingredient-hierarchy__box--accent" />
      <text x="125" y="29" text-anchor="middle">GGA energy density</text>
      <text x="125" y="55" text-anchor="middle">εxc(nσ, ∇nσ)</text>
      <text x="125" y="79" text-anchor="middle">半局域：同一点的密度与梯度</text>
    </g>

    <text x="380" y="316" text-anchor="middle">nonlocal density, orbitals, τ, and response variables are outside this input level</text>
  </svg>

  <dl class="ingredient-hierarchy__fallback">
    <div>
      <dt>LSDA</dt>
      <dd>在每个位置只读取 <code>n↑(r)</code> 与 <code>n↓(r)</code>，并套用均匀电子气的交换—关联能量密度。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>GGA</dt>
      <dd>在同一位置加入密度梯度，通常重写成 <code>s</code>、<code>t</code> 和 <code>ζ</code> 等无量纲变量。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>边界 | Boundary</dt>
      <dd>“使用更多局域信息”不等于包含真正的长程非局域相关，也不等于自动提高任一具体 observable 的精度。</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>区分 LSDA/GGA 的输入变量层级，避免把泛函名称当作材料精度结论。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> distinguish the input level of LSDA and GGA without turning a functional label into a material-accuracy claim.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>图与语义列表必须同时指出 LSDA 的局域自旋密度输入、GGA 的梯度输入，以及未包含的非局域/轨道变量。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> both the diagram and semantic fallback identify local spin densities, gradient inputs, and the variables absent from this semilocal level.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>图示是输入结构，不表示任一泛函的数值误差、势的光滑性或特定材料表现。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this diagram describes inputs, not numerical errors, potential smoothness, or material-specific performance.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

